Value NEIGHBOR_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value PRIORITY (\d+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value UPTIME (\S+)
Value DEAD_TIME (\S+)
Value ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^Neighbor\s+ID\s+Pri\s+State -> Begin
  ^\s*$$
  ^\.\s*$$

Begin
  ^${NEIGHBOR_ID}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${STATE}\s+${UPTIME}\s+${DEAD_TIME}\s+${ADDRESS}\s+${INTERFACE} -> Record
  ^\s*$$
